OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Fthis evening will quickly fade,
OL,7,Fleading to a clear and dry night.
OL,8,FFeeling chilly with temperatures
OL,9,Ffalling to single-digits, and a risk
OL,10,Fof grass frost and a few fog patches
OL,11,Ffor inland rural spots.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FAn increasingly breezy day
OL,14,Fon Wednesday as a strengthening
OL,15,Fsouthwesterly wind develops.
OL,16,FOtherwise, sunny spells becoming
OL,17,Fincreasingly limited throughout the
OL,18,Fday, but remaining largely dry until
OL,19,Fafter dark. Feeling mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
