OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FIncreasingly cloudy on Thursday with
OL,7,Foutbreaks of heavy rain and strong
OL,8,Fwinds. Dry with sunny spells on Friday
OL,9,Fbut remaining breezy. Cooler on
OL,10,FSaturday with light winds and sunny
OL,11,Fspells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
